<title>FINLAND: ELCOTEQ 1996 PROFIT AFTER FIN ITEMS FIM 33.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELCOTEQ 1996 PROFIT AFTER FIN ITEMS FIM 33.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31 vs 10</p>
<p>months to Dec 31, 1995,	     (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			  33.9 vs 76.5 (10 mth)</p>
<p> Net sales					  988.1 vs 755.6 (10mth)</p>
<p> Operating profit				  48.7 vs 83.3 (10 mth)</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		 39.69 vs 105.49 (10mth)</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish electronics component maker is</p>
<p>Elcoteq Network Oy.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
